{"status": 200, "body": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/328835418", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/328835418/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/328835418/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/tag/0.15.0", "id": 328835418, "author": {"login": "alufers", "id": 5400940, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDA5NDA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5400940?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers", "html_url": "https://github.com/alufers", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOHUi4BM4TmaFa", "tag_name": "0.15.0", "target_commitish": "master", "name": "uv migration, dependency updates, bugfixes", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-05-25T11:33:32Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-25T11:38:54Z", "published_at": "2026-05-25T11:38:54Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/tarball/0.15.0", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/zipball/0.15.0", "body": "  - Python 3.14 is the default version used in CI and docker container\r\n  - Python 3.12 is the minimum supported Python version\r\n  -  Upgraded mitmproxy from 11.0.2 to 12.2.3\r\n  - Fix UnicodeEncodeError when saving swagger file on Windows \u2014 thanks @MrTheFall (#212)\r\n  - Fix flow files being misdetected as HAR when first bytes contain only printable characters (e.g. certificates) \u2014 thanks @kristiandueholm (#215)\r\n  - Fix path parameters being dropped when using --headers flag \u2014 thanks @matgoebl (#216)\r\n  - Fix AttributeError: 'str' object has no attribute 'decode' when processing HAR files with form-encoded bodies \u2014 thanks @sarah-github (#174)\r\n  - Fix request headers never being included in parameters for HAR files (missing return in get_request_headers)\r\n  - Fix request headers and query parameters not both appearing when using --headers with HAR files\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nInternals:\r\n- Bumped pytest, pytest-asyncio, pytest-cov, openapi-spec-validator to latest versions\r\n- migrate the project from poetry to uv\r\n- use ruff for linting \r\n- migrate from pre-commit to prek \r\n", "mentions_count": 4}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/190430522", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/190430522/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/190430522/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/alufers/mitmproxy2swagger/releases/tag/0.14.0", "id": 190430522, "author": {"login": "alufers", "id": 5400940, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDA5NDA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5400940?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers", "html_url": "https://github.com/alufers", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alufers/starred{/owner}{/rep